{
	chapter.01C2D64320CBA756.title: "Cobblemon"
	chapter.58FD0DDD46EF0A83.title: "Create"
	chapter.7B56A289A1BC68D5.title: "Beginings"
	quest.001201DAFCC3FAEC.title: "Drink Mayonnaise"
	quest.001B6ED37355CE57.quest_subtitle: "Use a filter to remove the impurities from the Horse Urine you collected."
	quest.001B6ED37355CE57.title: "First Step in Processing"
	quest.00509ECAA5212D21.quest_subtitle: "The Pulse Timer is used to pulse repeatedly at a set interval."
	quest.00735810B03E0333.title: "Bake your first Stroopwafel"
	quest.00A79CAA6844228D.title: "Obtain Plastic"
	quest.00DFC7824C3750FB.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to haunt items.\\n\\nNotably sand into soul sand."
	quest.00F11AE1E586D83D.quest_subtitle: "Potato Cannons are a classic weapon to have, just remember to have suitable ammo in your inventory or this thing is useless."
	quest.012801DAD1E80663.quest_subtitle: "Display Boards are a scalable alternative to the Sign."
	quest.0135DF76611A4A25.quest_subtitle: "Smart Chutes behave similarly to Brass Funnels. They can be filtered to only allow certain items through, and be stopped with a redstone signal. Unlike funnels, they can insert and extract at the same time, but can only function vertically."
	quest.0138F3EB263D1721.quest_subtitle: "The block that deals with train assembly and dissasembly."
	quest.0148D094A35294EB.quest_subtitle: "You'll need to be either lucky or have a lot of thorium for this"
	quest.01C410421657C191.quest_subtitle: "Press &d\"R\"&r to See Crafts and &d\"Z\"&r to See How to build Towers"
	quest.01C410421657C191.title: "Pollution"
	quest.021E30871E97C634.quest_subtitle: "An advanced item distribution machine that works if you make it point to specific points that the arm can reach, if it can't reach, the arm won't work, also requires SUs to move it."
	quest.02903C6F107C8DA0.quest_subtitle: "Finally, nuclear"
	quest.0306E0A1DA82A811.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that outputs a signal when in contact with another redstone contact. Perticularly useful for building contraptions."
	quest.03FAA1891E7D56FD.quest_subtitle: "A more configurable chute."
	quest.042FF0D46F325E31.title: "Use an Curving Press to process materials"
	quest.0441D083400CD2DE.quest_subtitle: "The Stock Link is used to connect Packagers to Logistics Networks."
	quest.046435AD378CE0C8.quest_subtitle: "Best of the best Magnets in store, however extremely expensive"
	quest.056C707476E4BA33.quest_subtitle: "You will require either of these to insert fuel into the inserter"
	quest.056C707476E4BA33.title: "Inserting fuel "
	quest.05BC7CBC05B15830.quest_subtitle: "Pushes heat to a small area, careful to not pump too much heat.."
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.quest_subtitle: "Okay so, andesite is a very abundant stone that you can find in large pockets underground, and they blend really well with the stone texture so keep your eyes open for some. You'll need a lot of this stone if you are going to make any machinery around here so dig as much as you can! Mental note as well, Zinc ores are important too as using it with andesite makes the important alloy used to making machinery."
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.title: "Andesite, the Foundation"
	quest.062F228BCAE231E6.quest_subtitle: "When a Package Filter is used in a Filter slot, a create component such as a Brass Tunnel or Smart Chute will sort Cardboard Packages depending on if they match the address in the filter."
	quest.063D47D4F61457BC.quest_subtitle: "Lets you schedule trains so that mobs or blaze burnders can drive them."
	quest.06653E21053ACDF6.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that toggles on when recieving a redstone signal on one side and off when recieviing a signal on anoter side."
	quest.074AE1E3FB1810AC.quest_subtitle: "The Hand Crank generates a small amount of Rotational Force through player interaction."
	quest.07680D1563629D55.quest_subtitle: "It's really just a belt that doesn't move."
	quest.076C02684CB6D760.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
	quest.076C02684CB6D760.title: "Build Crude Oil Pump"
	quest.079E492B5D991F98.quest_subtitle: "The Extendo Grip is a tool that can be used to increase the player's reach."
	quest.07EC98B85252AB20.quest_subtitle: "The Water Wheel is a source of rotational power. It generates Rotational Force when water flows over it."
	quest.0945E885A92D06B7.quest_subtitle: "The simplest way to generate kinetic energy, by using yourself as the power source. Get that arm strength!"
	quest.0945E885A92D06B7.title: "Crank it all the way!"
	quest.095C1249FDE419C7.quest_subtitle: "Melt my heart.."
	quest.095C1249FDE419C7.title: "Uh oh!"
	quest.099F60BCA0CF6846.quest_subtitle: "An Elevator Pulley is a Contraption useful for creating multi-floor elevators easily."
	quest.09C97D4DF55501A3.quest_subtitle: "Lucky"
	quest.09F5744CA666F889.title: "Enjoy your first Oliebollen"
	quest.09FCD1E3012A990F.quest_subtitle: "The Redstone Link is used to send and receive redstone signals to other links."
	quest.0A2167437E1C4F13.quest_subtitle: "A repeater that sends a pulse after a configurable amount of time."
	quest.0A2167437E1C4F13.title: "Do I feel a pulse?"
	quest.0A6F439E158D1525.quest_subtitle: "A filter that can filter by attributes like \"can be smelted\" or \"from Create\"."
	quest.0AC1D662AE94C51C.quest_subtitle: "Welcome, to start chose your pokedex color here."
	quest.0AC1D662AE94C51C.title: "Starting in cobblemon"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.quest_subtitle: "Gadgets for all situations"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.title: "Welcome to Create:Connected"
	quest.0B3BEE4AFD2411DA.quest_subtitle: "The Millstone is a more basic equivalent of the Crushing Wheels, and is most likely the first of the two that the Player will construct. It is capable of applying milling recipes to any valid items inserted from above."
	quest.0B5FF13E714BF391.quest_subtitle: "Lets you see the rotational speed of a kinetic network."
	quest.0BAC663F488B1095.title: "Assemble a Redstone Module"
	quest.0BB0533CA61648D9.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
	quest.0BB0533CA61648D9.title: "Obtain All the Engines and go bbrrrrr"
	quest.0C28FF9D09B326D7.quest_subtitle: "Used to visualise and control which direction trains go in intersections."
	quest.0C8D19B106618A91.quest_subtitle: "The Gearbox is sort of like an extension cord, but for shafts where it can change the direction of the shafts and can have more than one shaft attached in a different side of the gearbox. A vertical gearbox also exists."
	quest.0D1289DF86B1D1D2.quest_subtitle: "A Blaze Burner is a heating component that is required for certain Mixing recipes. It can be used for heating Steam Engines, Bulk Smoking, Bulk Smelting, and as a decorative light source. Find a blaze and right click it with a empty blaze burner to get one."
	quest.0D42B48EA65AAED4.quest_subtitle: "Laugh at them"
	quest.0D42B48EA65AAED4.title: "Beat another person"
	quest.0D7069552EB099D4.quest_subtitle: "Choose your enchantments."
	quest.0DAD9AEBC7539334.quest_subtitle: "The Andesite Funnel is used to extract or insert materials into inventories, similar in nature to the Brass Funnel."
	quest.0DB0801CB423315D.quest_subtitle: "The Steam Engine is a block that provides Rotational Force. It outputs the highest Stress Unit (SU) capacity of all the survival-mode power-generating blocks. It converts the pressure caused by heating Water in a Fluid Tank into Rotational Force, allowing for large scale item production and multiple contraptions."
	quest.0E1E056EBC1B0E57.title: "Wrap snack in Paper"
	quest.0E491A562DF88795.quest_subtitle: "Weighted Ejectors can throw items accuratly long distances."
	quest.0EDDA7C7E4029565.title: "Bring a fossil pokemon back"
	quest.0F35AF004588B678.quest_subtitle: "The thing your train goes on. No tracks, no train."
	quest.0F35AF004588B678.title: "Train Tracks"
	quest.0F9CC22264DF80E8.quest_subtitle: "When powered, extends a redstone pulse for a specified time, much like a Redstone Repeater. The time can be set in its Value Settings Screen accessed by holding right-click. It can be set to extend a signal for 2 ticks up to 60 minutes. The settings can also be copied and pasted onto other extenders or Pulse Repeaters by using a Clipboard."
	quest.0FB4FFD361C5DF69.quest_subtitle: "It's just a seat, nothing more, nothing less. But if you're in a moving contraption, might as well glue it to the contraption so you can sit and move along with it. Don't superglue yourself to the seat."
	quest.0FB4FFD361C5DF69.title: "Chair."
	quest.0FBB5A02F560CAB9.quest_subtitle: "The Analog Lever is used to emit a variable signal."
	quest.0FCB25BA5EB5E745.quest_subtitle: "Chains together individual Minecarts, causing them to move as a group"
	quest.0FF39255BD5908AD.title: "Crush Nether Wart to obtain Spices"
	quest.10331210B10CF626.quest_subtitle: "Lets you use SU to break blocks, can also be attached to contraptions to make tunnel bores and the like."
	quest.10622C9E74C50A95.quest_subtitle: "Seats are used to allow multiple entities to ride a Contraption. Seats come in every color of Dye. They function much like a Boat in that they can be ridden by players and mobs"
	quest.10F1FE4B7907DF37.quest_subtitle: "The Smart Observer is a machine that emits a redstone signal dependent on the block or items inside a container in front of it."
	quest.111C3069CE77EFF2.quest_subtitle: "Attribute filters focus only on data. The filter can Allow items with any of the desired attributes, only allow them if they have all of the desired attributes, or deny items with any of the selected attributes. A reference item is required to show and choose attributes, but attributes can be added by multiple items."
	quest.1209EAFCD7457303.quest_subtitle: "Use to check for Crude Oil Deposits. Create Diesel Generators"
	quest.1283AD09A6377D92.title: "Obtain Slag"
	quest.12913E20A87ABA1F.quest_subtitle: "Allows for the creation of contraptions that move up and down."
	quest.12962FC09F1ACBCF.quest_subtitle: "The Chain Conveyor is used to transport Cardboard Packages."
	quest.12C789BF2D021A55.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to smoke items."
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.quest_desc: [
		"At the bottom of the inventory, you may have noticed a search bar."
		""
		"This is the &dJust Enough Items&r, or &dJEI&r, search bar. "
		""
		"If you type \"Wood\", for example, the &dJEI &ritem list at the right of the screen will show all items with \"Wood\" in the name."
		""
		"Adding a @ at the start of the search query will show the items from a specific mod, for example @Adorn"
		""
		"To favorite an item, press &bA &rwhile hovering over it in the &dJEI &ritem list."
	]
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.title: "&bJust Enough Items (JEI)"
	quest.13D0C3A396600BC2.quest_subtitle: "A Minecart that can fit many things."
	quest.13D4FF6929AE8D8F.quest_subtitle: "An item that allows for increased reach."
	quest.13D6B112D6534D9D.quest_subtitle: "The Rotation Speed Controller is a mechanical component that allows the player to precisely control rotational speed."
	quest.14E0A5E1BA5DFA57.title: "Generating heat"
	quest.152333F57A5C1913.quest_subtitle: "Crafts plates into rods and rods into wires."
	quest.155F388D56FB4A5F.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that can fell trees or allow contraptions to fell trees. As well as some crafting recipes like cutting blocks or stripping logs."
	quest.155F388D56FB4A5F.title: "Non-Portable Chainsaw"
	quest.155FBDDA1C6194CA.quest_subtitle: "Lets you turn off parts of contraptions while they are formed."
	quest.15F53F788D18518A.title: "Build Industrial Blasting"
	quest.16BBC50059227084.quest_subtitle: "Make your own music disc´s."
	quest.16BBC50059227084.title: "Etched"
	quest.16CD1CC9F70A91AF.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to halve or double the rotational speed of connected chaindrives when recieving a redstone signal."
	quest.16D5F3DF58B589A9.quest_desc: ["To open the menu to edit voice chat settings and enable it in the first place hit \"v\". Even if you dont plan on using it enable it so you can hear others. \"y\" is the default push to talk button."]
	quest.16D5F3DF58B589A9.quest_subtitle: "Yes we have proximity chat"
	quest.1742597D48E37800.quest_desc: [
		"All of Create is based around Create, obviously, a steampunk mod that lets you build contraptions to do most things you can think of, just not how to do your laundry nor your homework, okay?"
		""
		"Create offers great guides for most of its items by hovering over them in REI or in your inventory and holding down 'W' to \"ponder\" the item, but sometimes it's just best to test each thing out, go big or go home, as the saying goes."
		""
		"Because of this, the chapter is mostly focused on letting you know what exists and giving you a rough outline of the progression of the mod, but at the same time, it will not handhold you all the way to the end since Create is a free for all sandbox mechanic mod. Get building and be smarter."
	]
	quest.1742597D48E37800.quest_subtitle: "&8[Click to read]"
	quest.1742597D48E37800.title: "&6Welcome to All of Create!"
	quest.175099CF5696829E.quest_desc: [
		"&9Tasks &rare things that need to be done to complete a quest. If a task is an item, clicking on it will show its recipe."
		""
		"&6Rewards &rare what you get after completing all &9Tasks&r. Click to claim."
		""
		"The pin icon at the top right will pin a quest to your screen."
	]
	quest.175099CF5696829E.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.175099CF5696829E.title: "&6Quests"
	quest.17541CB8E37D10F1.quest_subtitle: "Generates energy(E) from kinetic energy, the amount generated is dependent on the rpm and caps at 256E/t"
	quest.1812A79944021D76.quest_subtitle: "Think of wires all connecting from several places into a single point."
	quest.1812A79944021D76.title: "Touch"
	quest.18BC418C8CFD35CC.quest_subtitle: "Sneak to become a package."
	quest.18BC418C8CFD35CC.title: "Cardboard Armor"
	quest.19166D31F298D0D5.quest_subtitle: "Basically an advanced sign that updates faster if provided with higher RPM. It's like a Bulletin Board you see in train stations that update."
	quest.19183F380B49F31C.quest_subtitle: "A very versitile machine that can pull and push entities aswell as wash, haunt, blast and smoke items. No, this is not for household use."
	quest.19B1A849EE98B04C.quest_subtitle: "Lets you see through the eyes of a conductor as well as control their movement."
	quest.19C6960EEE60376C.quest_subtitle: "Blast trough the water to wash items."
	quest.19E17F6AAFAB9B70.quest_desc: [
		"Thank you for playing on this server, I spent a while on this. Quick intro I recommend you read this. This server is focused on cobblemon and create, so use them if you wanna have fun."
		"important keybinds"
		"x - vein mine"
		"g - open your pokemon menu"
		"f - dodge roll"
		"r - throw selected pokemon"
		"arrow keys - change selected pokemon"
		"c - zoom"
		"There is a claims addition too, (ftb claims) so claim land you want to build on to prevent people from robbing you. You can open the claim map with \"j\" to see the claim map, and \"c\" while you are in it to allow you to claim your own, and just drag your mouse over the chunks you wish to claim. You can see other quests by looking at the menu on the left (hover you mouse over the arrow). You can also add people to your team (team button on the top left of your inventory) to allow you all to progress quests together and build on each others claims. The quest book will also always be accessible from up in the left corner."
	]
	quest.19E17F6AAFAB9B70.quest_subtitle: "Welcome"
	quest.19E17F6AAFAB9B70.title: "Begginings (please read)"
	quest.1A541F8D6FF3C21B.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to wash items.\\n\\nNotably soul sand into nether quartz."
	quest.1ABC2ADBFEF3144D.quest_subtitle: "Connectors insert/extract energy from/into blocks and wires are used to connect between connectors."
	quest.1BAE590C1F42160D.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
	quest.1BAE590C1F42160D.title: "Build a Distillation"
	quest.1BEB3BA82B493610.quest_subtitle: "The Postbox will move Cardboard Packages to and from Trains with an inventory that stop at its linked Train Station. It will take packages with a matching address or deposit packages that don’t match its address."
	quest.1C8270ED93BBC803.quest_subtitle: "The Item Hatch is used to deposit a player’s inventory into storage."
	quest.1C901D6957027EB8.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Create Central Kitchen, a mod offering more tools and methods to automate food processing for other mods in Create."
	quest.1CE628E887170EB7.title: "Trade for a pokemon"
	quest.1CE6DB5F873483AF.quest_subtitle: "Chutes are used to transfer between inventories vertically."
	quest.1D6E3B45533738C3.title: "Craft Steel Mechanism"
	quest.1D87880EAC335129.quest_subtitle: "Collect Horse Urine by \"milking\" a horse with a bottle."
	quest.1D87880EAC335129.title: "Collect Horse Urine"
	quest.1E4200A0817D30D3.quest_subtitle: "The Cogwheel is a basic mechanical component in Create that relays rotation."
	quest.1E452DB4DCAD2939.title: "Obtain Crude Oil"
	quest.1F529352FAC8FA15.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Arm is a block used to transfer items."
	quest.1FCEADEF0E5436BD.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
	quest.1FCEADEF0E5436BD.title: "Build Coke "
	quest.20112BFDA2553840.quest_subtitle: "Super glue is important for connecting things together to work/move as one thing."
	quest.205DCDADC7B500B9.quest_subtitle: "A builder's best friend, this extension is going to be handy when reaching far and is perfect for building not only aesthetically, but also machinery with practicality."
	quest.208ADE3D28CEB3E6.quest_subtitle: "Package Frogports are used to move Cardboard Packages from and to Chain Conveyors."
	quest.2165E80C52C79992.quest_desc: [
		"Press &bR &rwhile hovering over an item to view its Recipe"
		""
		"Press &bU &rwhile hovering over an item to view its Uses"
		""
		"Press &bX &rto Crawl"
		""
		"Press &bRight Click &rwhile crouching to hold a block. (Useful for chests, doesn't work on all blocks)"
		""
		"Press &bC &rto Zoom"
		""
		"Press &bM &rto open the World Map"
		""
		"Press &bN &rto Create a New Waypoint"
		""
		"Press &bU&r to see Player Death History"
		""
		"Press &bO&r to view the Claiming Screen"
		"{@pagebreak}"
	]
	quest.2165E80C52C79992.quest_subtitle: "Read my description! Make sure to scroll down."
	quest.2165E80C52C79992.title: "&9Important Controls"
	quest.219E307B851DB05A.quest_subtitle: "Lets you reverse the direction of rotation by applying redstone."
	quest.21A6AC286292BA6D.quest_subtitle: "No blaze burner needed! (only works on boilers if you didn't already notice the name)"
	quest.21D00F543014D0BC.quest_subtitle: "Mechanical Saws are powered through rotational force, and when placed down facing to the side they will automatically chop down wood blocks in front of them. When chopping down a tree or giant mushroom, it will automatically destroy the entire tree by only destroying the bottom-most block."
	quest.21DD4EFBB31B669D.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Copper Backtank. How is there so much defense if you're not protected from the front, though?"
	quest.2246A107ECC3CBC5.quest_subtitle: "Ooh, this is a fun contraption! Okay, so this thing is used to build your structures automatically, provided that you have a structure printed out in your schematic paper. You just need to prepare gunpowder and a storage unit with the required materials to build what you want. Also use a clipboard, will ya? It'll take note of the materials for you."
	quest.227597F357AA480D.quest_subtitle: "Allows for the extraction of liquids from items."
	quest.230E8B3569AF31C2.title: "Cover yourself in oil"
	quest.231C8943A649FD16.quest_subtitle: "Apply a Distillation Controller to a Fluid tank to create a Distillation Tower."
	quest.2377F87E4B43F304.title: "Reel in 10 pokemon"
	quest.23D1935F6FBE0303.quest_subtitle: "Same as the Andesite Track Switch but also allows for switching for scheduled trains."
	quest.23DD9942E2B57F41.quest_subtitle: "Go outside ?"
	quest.23DD9942E2B57F41.title: "Beat 50 of each type of pokemon"
	quest.23E494D48D76CE85.quest_subtitle: "The Train Observer is used to detect passing Trains."
	quest.24E234AFB1CE8B59.title: "Obtain Steel"
	quest.24E88C05F00647B1.quest_subtitle: "Train Controls are required in the creation of Trains."
	quest.2545476F450C03AD.quest_subtitle: "The Rope Pulley creates Contraptions much like a Mechanical Piston, but in only one direction and without the need for Piston Extension Poles."
	quest.2550A75D8A031F9E.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
	quest.2550A75D8A031F9E.title: "Build an Advanced Distillation"
	quest.26D7ADB984AA5EB1.quest_subtitle: "Fast and rather reliable. Make sure your runway is long enough"
	quest.27474DC1059FC89D.quest_subtitle: "A schematic with a pattern function"
	quest.276FAE76C917913E.quest_subtitle: "chest boy"
	quest.27C06C60461A5476.title: "Deepfry fries"
	quest.282C3F04D7E7C4F3.title: "Bake Your First Speculaas Cookie"
	quest.282E21725CEBD4F2.quest_subtitle: "Conductors allow you to activate redstone whilst looking at them and can also carry your toolbox around."
	quest.282E21725CEBD4F2.title: "Conductors"
	quest.293196C72E44A5AC.quest_subtitle: "Lets you clear and pave whilst riding a train."
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.quest_desc: [
		"The icon in the top left of the screen is the &aFTB Teams &rmenu. This allows you to add other players to your team."
		""
		"On the right of the &aFTB Teams &ricon is the &6Quest Book &ricon, which allows you to access the &6Quest Book &rat any time."
		""
		"When you click the square at the top left of your player display, your &8Curios &rslots will become visible. Some items, such as Elytras and Totems can be equipped here."
		""
		""
	]
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.title: "&2Inventory"
	quest.29649C654117D56A.quest_subtitle: "A lever that can be set to output any redstone level. It's basically an upgraded version of the basic lever."
	quest.29649C654117D56A.title: "Levered Up!"
	quest.29651727750CA09A.quest_subtitle: "So a Cog Crank is just essentially a Hand Crank, but instead of putting a crank on blocks or machinery, this crank is used for rotational force and direction of cogwheels."
	quest.29651727750CA09A.title: "Crank it all the way!"
	quest.29EFF7AED691682B.quest_subtitle: "Lets you instantly break most Create blocks by shift + right-clicking. And rotate them by right-clicking."
	quest.29EFF7AED691682B.title: "This is not a Monkey Wrench"
	quest.2A0F7A2AA1C0E9C1.quest_subtitle: "A basic filter."
	quest.2A1A0E1881772371.quest_subtitle: "The Sticker is used to stick and unstick things to moving Contraptions."
	quest.2A47F0A4B8F515C2.quest_subtitle: "Vintage Improvements's most important resource"
	quest.2A47F0A4B8F515C2.title: "Obtain Iron Spring"
	quest.2AB0806AA6A7076C.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Copper Diving Helmet. The icon from afar looks like a helmet for a soldier."
	quest.2AB09D3D9432B8F3.quest_subtitle: "The Factory Gauge is used to send requests through a Logistics Network to maintain an amount of an item in the linked storage."
	quest.2AFA69E8C6BCF178.quest_subtitle: "The shaft is a basic mechanical component in Create. A shaft can be used to connect two mechanical components such that the rotation of one rotates the other, and shafts serve as the only blocks upon which Mechanical Belts can be placed."
	quest.2B064304B2B87C82.quest_subtitle: "The Clutch stops outgoing rotation when a redstone signal is applied."
	quest.2BC564546A48616B.quest_subtitle: "Allows for contraptions that rotate around a point in space, particularly useful for farms."
	quest.2C3CD6663D38750A.quest_subtitle: "You know those hydraulic presses in real life? This is basically it. Don't put your hand under it."
	quest.2C770179FF6B1F73.quest_subtitle: "This is not a Star Wars film, don't think you have the Force."
	quest.2C770179FF6B1F73.title: "Lightsaber!!"
	quest.2C8EF8E65133D178.quest_subtitle: "In order to get brass you're going to need to heat a mechanical mixer that's mixing copper and zinc.\\n\\n the Empty Blaze burner can be filled by right-clicking it on either a blaze spawner or a blaze."
	quest.2C8EF8E65133D178.title: "Blaze Burner"
	quest.2C96A172ACC0226F.quest_subtitle: "Remember to cover your rods before activating... or it's going to be chernobyl."
	quest.2C96A172ACC0226F.title: "Reactor 101"
	quest.2CC43C68A8EECB8D.quest_subtitle: "The densest kinetic source. Although it also has the highest complexity, requiring a steady source of water and heat, and no this is not a steam locomotive like Thomas the Tank Engine."
	quest.2CC43C68A8EECB8D.title: "Full Steam Ahead!"
	quest.2D0B2D01669E88DD.quest_subtitle: "Simply a Potato Cannon."
	quest.2E10D93D926631F6.quest_subtitle: "An item used to craft more advanced mechanical items."
	quest.2F07087EE904E14F.quest_subtitle: "All Aboarrrrddddd!! Get that train ready and moving!"
	quest.2F3D6B5C4F3F5A7C.quest_subtitle: "Train Stations are used to create, disassemble, and guide Trains."
	quest.2F6DE76A988D87C2.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Harvester is a component used on Contraptions to harvest crops."
	quest.306E26FB7650939B.title: "Craft Exhaust"
	quest.30C1D45E7545FA6C.quest_subtitle: "Connect with a heat source into a boiler heater, spreads heat across all pipes evenly unless pumped."
	quest.30D7DB66D96F6059.quest_subtitle: "\"I am you, but stronger.\""
	quest.3112C152D85B81B9.quest_subtitle: "Engineer's Goggles are a wearable item that allow the user to see more details about placed machines."
	quest.312320F8FF1FDF24.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Copper Diving Boots."
	quest.3163768E54FA4D87.quest_subtitle: "You know what a windmill is, right? This uses wind to spin around and generate SUs for use."
	quest.3163768E54FA4D87.title: "Don't get blown away"
	quest.31931F0456B30D23.quest_subtitle: "Table Cloths can be used to sell items to other players."
	quest.31D27BC289311172.quest_subtitle: "The Schematicannon is a special type of machine used to build structures with the use of Schematics."
	quest.322B3211C261CDB5.quest_subtitle: "A Desk Bell plays a sound and emits a redstone signal when right-clicked."
	quest.3395388771D6B0A9.quest_subtitle: "Most machines have a built in filter used to determine how they treat inputs. List Filters are used to adjust the treatment of multiple items at once."
	quest.345EEBD0D6C065D6.quest_subtitle: "Chicken Egg Generator"
	quest.34DAAF880FC0F5BB.title: "Deepfry Churros"
	quest.367D1A20BE7A93B6.quest_subtitle: "The Packager is used to create Cardboard Packages."
	quest.3736B545828490F1.quest_subtitle: "Some fluids can be infinity extracted from the world as long as the pool the hose pulley is extracting from contains 10000 or more source blocks.\\n\\nYou can search in REI for the fluids that apply using by typing \"$create:bottomless\""
	quest.3742A8E0846B3D80.quest_subtitle: "The Sequenced Gearshift allows finer control over Rotational power, allowing multiple changes to the rotation over a period of time."
	quest.37F2213B50CA5112.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Piston is a piston that can push Contraptions when powered with Rotational Power."
	quest.3808295BE9ABFB6C.quest_subtitle: "Gotta catch them all"
	quest.384CD5BDE179AE31.quest_subtitle: "SU is the main force that makes things turn/move in create"
	quest.385C156051820A7B.quest_subtitle: "Stores pressurized air for usage with a diving helmet. In other words, the oxygen needed to breathe underwater."
	quest.3887DB2CA518BC26.quest_subtitle: "A useful block for building contraptions."
	quest.390CA48CD622B19F.title: "Deepfry a snack"
	quest.39CF18F0C2B06818.quest_subtitle: "A multi-block structure that lets you store large amounts of energy."
	quest.39E865F0D72CF9B8.quest_subtitle: "A Shaft is another basic but important machinery part that is required to make anything move with rotation. You can also extend the shaft to make it longer and affect more than one contraption that requires rotation."
	quest.39E865F0D72CF9B8.title: "Rod of Constant Rotation"
	quest.3A861B21F4724A9A.quest_subtitle: "Use on a Diesel Engine make it faster. Create Diesel Generators"
	quest.3A95793467582862.quest_subtitle: "Muscle-powered copter. Give it a good push and off it flies!"
	quest.3B10D31EFD80798C.quest_subtitle: "Lets you create your own custom functional clock."
	quest.3B925864D243F779.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that allow contraptions to harvest crops."
	quest.3C1CAF0BD309141B.quest_subtitle: "The Clockwork Bearing is an advanced version of the Mechanical Bearing for rotating up to two clock hands according to the current in-game time."
	quest.3C1E7E02FDDFF8E3.quest_subtitle: "If you know how Create's item vault and filters work, this is similar."
	quest.3C67BDE80F43FF9E.quest_subtitle: "Lets you charge certain items."
	quest.3D11842DDDE1D396.quest_subtitle: "Terminoloy:\\n\\nStress Units(SU) a number that describes how much stress something generates or requires to run.\\n\\n"
	quest.3D11842DDDE1D396.title: "I'm so stressed! I need to measure it!"
	quest.3D6A771583B33400.title: "Use an Compressor to process materials"
	quest.3DA659956B952FCD.quest_subtitle: "The Threshold Switch measures how full an inventory is and can emit a Redstone signal at adjustable thresholds."
	quest.3DE38636656DD1F6.quest_subtitle: "Okay, I may be exaggerating a little, but redstone also plays a vital role to Create that the blocks in here make redstone contraptions more compact but also a bit more complicated, have fun studying."
	quest.3DE38636656DD1F6.title: "Redstone + Create = Complicated"
	quest.3DF4AAAD10E90C96.quest_subtitle: "Awesome"
	quest.3E7BA0A99DFFD97B.quest_subtitle: "To get a Gholdengo you need to feed a gimmighoul 999x relic coins. Have fun."
	quest.3EADB5F22FAD4A56.quest_subtitle: "An upgrade to the andesite tunnel allowing more configurability in how to deal with items."
	quest.3F1469243ECCE270.quest_subtitle: "The Powered Latch emits a redstone signal that can be toggled on or off."
	quest.3F20E1456C92F278.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Foundry Basin and Foundry Top"
	quest.3F20E1456C92F278.title: "Better Blast Furnace"
	quest.3F8B59B04E26C1C2.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that only allows energy(E) to flow when it's receiving a redstone signal."
	quest.4007D36163F8555E.quest_subtitle: "Grinding it all down to dust."
	quest.408C34432E394C2B.quest_subtitle: "Extension cables, but instead of electricity, it is essentially an item cable."
	quest.408D9361AF8AA499.quest_subtitle: "A simple machine with massive potential. Can place blocks but also use items on blocks/entities."
	quest.4098698A9A1E1583.quest_subtitle: "Make yourself a backpack for a bigger inventory."
	quest.410BEC9893112A43.quest_subtitle: "Cogwheels are used to either increase rotational speed or to extend contraptions depending on the way they're facing. Play around with the sizes of the cogwheels and see what you can make out of them."
	quest.410BEC9893112A43.title: "Are they just gears, but named differently?"
	quest.413851654DCD65D3.quest_subtitle: "Get any non-dirty minerals dusts"
	quest.413851654DCD65D3.title: "Effective Factory!"
	quest.41E350FDE4D674C8.quest_subtitle: "Chutes transport items vertically, similarly to Mechanical Belts."
	quest.4206216A5F414642.quest_subtitle: "With the power of dried kelp, mechanical belts are useful in moving items either in a straight line and diagonally. Make sure to stick one shaft on each end to connect so it will work."
	quest.4206216A5F414642.title: "Don't wear this, it's not for clothes."
	quest.4230AD68B84A6FBE.quest_subtitle: "Perfect for building, and that's about it."
	quest.4234EABAC1AA2AE0.quest_subtitle: "The Depot is used as an interaction point for machines such as the Mechanical Arm."
	quest.423D181BB7A3975E.title: "Reel in a pokemon"
	quest.4267B97B18413E1D.quest_subtitle: "Since most blocks in Create don't allow for manual extraction and insertion of liquids these pipes are rather useful.\\n\\nCan also be used to create infinite water by extracting from a source-block that has 2 source-blocks adjacent to it."
	quest.42CE924B047FF8A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a Foundry Mixer"
	quest.42CE924B047FF8A6.title: "You Spin me Round!"
	quest.4363F5A8705C5B13.title: "Use an Centrifuge to process materials"
	quest.4377B43142216C8D.quest_subtitle: "A helmet that lets you use air from an equipped tank to breathe underwater. Don't even think of seeing this work under lava."
	quest.438ACCE0D9FC0BF3.quest_subtitle: "Slow and fuel hungry but carries an entire storage."
	quest.44AE17D3427B487C.quest_subtitle: "\"A fancier rope pulley\"\\n\\nAllows for the creation of elevators."
	quest.44C3B2628015505C.quest_subtitle: "Allows for movement of structures linearly using rotational force."
	quest.44C3B2628015505C.title: "Mechanical Piston"
	quest.44E0DDEE0578557F.quest_subtitle: "A multi-block item storage that can't be accessed manually. Not even a door can open it."
	quest.44FC080A04EF3970.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a Tungsten Ingot from Wolframite Ore"
	quest.44FC080A04EF3970.title: "The Tungsten Age"
	quest.4613F6388966DB43.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Create Enchantment Industry, a mod offering more tools and methods to handle experience and enchantment in Create."
	quest.4613F6388966DB43.title: "Enchantment Industry"
	quest.469D2AC3C48360B3.quest_subtitle: "The Cart Assembler can attach a Contraption to Minecarts that pass through it when supplied with a Redstone signal."
	quest.48E5D56C47DF6642.quest_subtitle: "The thing your train goes on."
	quest.48E5D56C47DF6642.title: "Train Tracks"
	quest.4918B0939E4604A0.quest_subtitle: "Have a look at your entire inventory like a computer looking at all their files in one place and access them."
	quest.4918B0939E4604A0.title: "Terminals"
	quest.496FC8106904193E.quest_subtitle: "Diesel Generators are a compact way of generating kinetic energy."
	quest.498B46B890735B82.quest_subtitle: "Use waystones to teleport around the world. Use the return scroll to return to the nearest waystone."
	quest.49901AE0CD7E39EF.title: "Craft Concrete Formwork"
	quest.49EE6F88CD93352E.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to blast items."
	quest.4A59ED3829D4D682.title: "Prepare Stamppot by Pressing Carrots and Potatoes in a Basin"
	quest.4A9E672C4D90A8CA.quest_subtitle: "The Wrench is a tool used to rotate, dismantle and configure components"
	quest.4AA3033E2554D625.title: "Deepfry ice?"
	quest.4B26338875672E05.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Plough is a component used to break non-collidable blocks"
	quest.4B99B70CD1506925.quest_subtitle: "connect both of these directly to a rod. (reminder that the inserter works ONLY in a straight line)"
	quest.4B99B70CD1506925.title: "Inserting fuel and pumping out heat"
	quest.4CA82D89B59B33F6.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Casting Basin or Casting Table"
	quest.4CA82D89B59B33F6.title: "Don't Try To Blow on It!"
	quest.4DD8EC6663F695BC.quest_subtitle: "Place down a Sequenced Pulse Generator"
	quest.4DD8EC6663F695BC.title: "Computational Supremacy"
	quest.4DF26110E63EDD02.quest_subtitle: "The Brass Funnel is a block that can extract or insert items into inventories, much like the Andesite Funnel."
	quest.4E0503134BFF19F0.quest_subtitle: "A block that can monitor the fill levels of inventories and tanks."
	quest.4E1D2DC78E017E20.title: "Card"
	quest.4E51ADEC551E7A95.quest_subtitle: "The Gearshift reverses outgoing Rotational Force when a Redstone signal is applied."
	quest.4E834477717F726A.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to control the train."
	quest.4E8D3CEF2950E465.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Estrogen Patches and enjoy your long lasting femininity."
	quest.4E8D3CEF2950E465.title: "(Almost) Permanent!"
	quest.4F1D2859F6BE40EF.quest_subtitle: "Train Tracks are special blocks used to support Trains."
	quest.4F61B1F3D1E2C6E2.quest_subtitle: "The main block used for bulk fluid storage."
	quest.4FB4112F160CF2B0.quest_subtitle: "good job killing so many inoccent animals"
	quest.50C0D23949DD8BE6.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to stop rotational force coming through when powered by a redstone signal."
	quest.511054E8740CDC84.title: "Obtain Molten Steel"
	quest.5127B6C5B44C1ADB.quest_subtitle: "Sends a pulse after delaying for a specified time"
	quest.512D1E50513754E6.quest_subtitle: "Make brand new food and plant new crops."
	quest.512D1E50513754E6.title: "Farmers Delight"
	quest.5192A23748C3AC21.quest_subtitle: "Deployer can now perform Cutting Board Recipes (Farmer's Delight) on Belt and Depot."
	quest.5192A23748C3AC21.title: "Cutting Board Recipe Automation"
	quest.51D48D32ED67E37C.title: "Obtain Recipe Card, Lathe automation item"
	quest.51D7B0737ED62747.quest_subtitle: "The Weighted Ejector flings items and entities to a targeted block up to 32 blocks away."
	quest.5214F91287D80E43.quest_subtitle: "Make yourself some furniture."
	quest.5214F91287D80E43.title: "Handcrafted"
	quest.523918A1D5E07E9E.quest_subtitle: "Redstone Contacts allow Contraptions to convey redstone signals or activate Redstone Circuits."
	quest.52490456CC021CD1.quest_subtitle: "Used to visualise valid paths for trains."
	quest.5272D9AC88702DE2.quest_subtitle: "Modular Diesel Generators function like normal Diesel generators. They can be stacked. They will generate stress proportionally to how much engines you stack."
	quest.52C1D5727A82A72F.quest_subtitle: "Tunnels are used to manage the flow of items on belts."
	quest.5301642EE0752220.quest_subtitle: "Lets you couple and decouple trains without dissasembly."
	quest.541988089F760BD6.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that toggles its state with every redstone pulse."
	quest.54326B24BD28FA83.quest_subtitle: "Give your Blaze a guide and turn it into a master chef! Blaze Stove will provide Mechanical Arm support for kitchenwares including: Cooking Pot (Farmer's Delight), Kettle (Farmer's Respite), Copper Pot (Miner's Delight). Blaze Stove can also boost cooking up to 4x for the kitchenware above!"
	quest.5435BF11EB742A73.quest_subtitle: "Blow a Shear Pin"
	quest.5435BF11EB742A73.title: "Snap!"
	quest.54A4E0568EAA9DF4.quest_subtitle: "You will need 12 blocks surronding a coil in order to maximize its energy generation"
	quest.54A4E0568EAA9DF4.title: "Strange rock?"
	quest.553C28959FC9DA28.quest_subtitle: "A Mechanical Belt is a mechanical component that conveys rotation and moves items and entities."
	quest.5573E400B5912AE4.quest_subtitle: "Train Signals are used to control the flow of Trains not driven by players."
	quest.557D78BBC799061F.quest_subtitle: "Train Schedules are used to instruct non-player Train conductors."
	quest.5611FCC58301372A.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to setup a sequence of rotations that are executed upon the block receiving a redstone signal."
	quest.563B74BC50D924A2.title: "Obtain Molten Slag"
	quest.563C76D529A4694B.quest_subtitle: "Mixes recipe´s"
	quest.5671A401F786D198.quest_subtitle: "The Windmill Sail is a block used to create a Windmill. You can connect multiple together without super glue, however you need a windmill bearing to use them and that requires superglue."
	quest.569D382481186F74.quest_subtitle: "Craft the elusive Estrogen Pill."
	quest.569D382481186F74.title: "Pill up gals!"
	quest.56C88820DD8DFC9D.quest_subtitle: "Contraption Controls are used to control Contraption Actors."
	quest.56E16ECAA3E2107D.title: "Use an Belt Grinder to process materials"
	quest.56FD7B7332D5B294.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Belt Grinder"
	quest.56FD7B7332D5B294.title: "What a Cheese Grater!"
	quest.57ACE6009859D77E.quest_subtitle: "Copycat Blocks can take on the appearance and properties of other blocks. They are generally used for decorative purposes, taking on the texture of another block while retaining the shape and size of narrow panels or steps."
	quest.58BA699805459F6F.title: "Obtain Cement"
	quest.58D007AD390CBCBB.quest_subtitle: "When Used, Redeems Experience points contained within."
	quest.5A07D5F76A89C1DC.title: "Use an Lathe to process materials"
	quest.5A0CA26E0A2AA6FD.quest_subtitle: "A Display Link is used to get information from a block and send it to blocks that can display it."
	quest.5AC2862AFF8D4231.quest_subtitle: "A decorative Tunnel for Mechanical Belts."
	quest.5B7634CE82DEF523.quest_subtitle: "Based around expressing yourself, fluid handling and expanding your factory!"
	quest.5B7634CE82DEF523.title: "Estrogen"
	quest.5BE0839CD1C90A7F.quest_subtitle: "Right click a stripped log with andesite alloy"
	quest.5BE16E289B22D902.quest_subtitle: "The Nixie Tube is a block that can display text or numbers."
	quest.5BFD146843E63614.quest_subtitle: "Stores your items."
	quest.5C06543962E420C4.quest_subtitle: "A motor that converts energy(E) into kinetic energy(SU) at any rpm."
	quest.5C251AB7110F0E5F.quest_subtitle: "Huge Diesel Engines connect to Shafts, they will start generating Kinetic Energy, once you give them some fuel."
	quest.5C5DE3ECE4E39C5F.quest_subtitle: "Trigger an Overstress Clutch"
	quest.5C5DE3ECE4E39C5F.title: "Circuit Breaker"
	quest.5CDDAD4D40B67D7B.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that extends a pulse to a configurable amount."
	quest.5CE78B938070D81B.title: "Bake your first Kruidnoten"
	quest.5D09455F583C6C9E.quest_subtitle: "Used for crafting train related items"
	quest.5D0986618729A519.quest_subtitle: "A block that can look for specific items in the world or in inventories."
	quest.5D0986618729A519.title: "I'm watching you."
	quest.5D19586551060173.quest_subtitle: "Used to connect electrical connectors."
	quest.5E04B024C8E9B865.quest_subtitle: "Used for filling items with fluids and crafting certain items using fluids."
	quest.5E783474BA6980E3.quest_subtitle: "You can craft while you're away from your main base, but remember that it is quite costly for such a benefit."
	quest.5EAA48B77D99A51B.quest_subtitle: "Will right click blocks for you"
	quest.5F54692C554A45BE.quest_subtitle: "Use on a Diesel Engine to silence it. Create Diesel Generators"
	quest.5FF617620A38A716.quest_subtitle: "As the name implies this item allows you to glue blocks together. Perticularly useful when making contraptions. Good thing we don't have fingers or the glue will stick to our hands... wait."
	quest.5FF9AD0A23CA1A86.title: "Obtain Vanadium Block"
	quest.60C91DB4E99253B8.title: "Obtain Limesand"
	quest.60D073A200595414.quest_subtitle: "Lets you see the current stress and stress capacity of a kinetic network, not the stress of someone else."
	quest.617D59D4F14FA3AE.quest_subtitle: "Allows for contraptions that traverse rails in the same way minecarts do."
	quest.618FF4D4A0FCC14C.quest_subtitle: "Lets you place down a mirror that assists you in building symmetrical things."
	quest.61D6F7DB6E8B68DC.title: "Use an Helve Hammer to process materials"
	quest.61F2A454627CAC36.quest_subtitle: "A Stock Ticker is used to request items from a Logistics Network."
	quest.62316183AAFBD68B.quest_subtitle: "Mixing Thorium, Stone and Clay in water will generate thorium"
	quest.62316183AAFBD68B.title: "Generating thorium"
	quest.63F4830C04865359.title: "Change Belt Grinder skin via right-click with an Sand Paper"
	quest.642172D58E8B11E1.quest_subtitle: "A kinetic source that uses the flow of water as its source of energy. Will generate the same amount of SU at the same RPM as long as one block of flowing water is adjacent.\\n\\nYou can also swich the look of your water wheel by right-clicking it with pretty much any wood plank (including ones from other mods)."
	quest.64341D7F6E892900.quest_subtitle: "Disenchant item and collect experience as liquid."
	quest.648C13279144617F.title: "Better solar"
	quest.6494FA13B4DE52FB.quest_subtitle: "CARDBOARD :D"
	quest.6494FA13B4DE52FB.title: "Carboard (new create update stuff)"
	quest.65A2AC554D856D93.quest_subtitle: "Allows for contraptions that move across gantries."
	quest.65EA25D2DDEE694F.quest_subtitle: "Slow but easy to maneuver. Immersive Aircraft"
	quest.666E9828756ADB0C.quest_subtitle: "The basis of most things fluid related in Create.\\n\\nCan also be used to encase fluid pipes."
	quest.66A35D1A11CBB671.quest_subtitle: "Assemble a Control Chip"
	quest.66A35D1A11CBB671.title: "Precision Fabrication"
	quest.66EB092315C08AAA.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
	quest.66EB092315C08AAA.title: "AHAHAH Pollution, who cares"
	quest.672C61B048CB3B85.quest_subtitle: "In order to make a train you're going to need at least:\\n- 1 Train Casing\\n- 1 Train Station\\n- Enough train tracks to make your railroad.\\n\\nIn order to see how you assemble a train \"ponder\" the train station."
	quest.67B3D0A82F1BB3EA.quest_subtitle: "The basis for more advanced blocks."
	quest.67CE399D0A9C0F57.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that both allow for automatic crafting of normal recipes and the crafting of recipes that are bigger than a normal crafting table would allow for."
	quest.6814CD8420D6DA66.quest_subtitle: "You heard it right lads, FE in create. You'll probably need more than your normal waterwheels to power this thing."
	quest.6814CD8420D6DA66.title: "FE in create?"
	quest.687E120574E93C63.title: "Obtain Copper Sulfate, copper based fertilizer"
	quest.68CC0DF64AD608C1.quest_subtitle: "Generates twice as much SU as the regular water wheel but at a slower RPM. Just know that this thing is bigger and bulkier so have a lot of space for it."
	quest.6933CF9259784296.title: "Use an Vibrating Table to process materials"
	quest.694D568E65C188C2.quest_subtitle: "Take some blaze cakes, its going to heat up!"
