	quest.6A4CB4700F0082C6.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.quest_desc: [
		"This tutorial will guide you through some basic features. Don't worry, it won't take &otoo &rlong!"
		""
		"To start, click the checkmark under the word \"&9Tasks&r\" and then claim the &6Quest Reward&r. New quests will start to appear!"
		""
		"If new quests do not start appearing, try rejoining your world. Do not eat the bread until the tutorial is finished."
	]
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.quest_subtitle: "To start the tutorial, click on this quest and read the description."
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.title: "&eWelcome to All of Create!"
	quest.6A85255CCCDE764F.quest_subtitle: "Blast trough the water to cook items."
	quest.6AAC04F1D0ECC1D5.quest_subtitle: "Okay, so this is really complicated to explain, but to narrow it down, this controller is it will take inputs from your gamepad using the layout provided by GLFW. If you don't have a GamePad controller, have fun rebinding your keybinds."
	quest.6AAC04F1D0ECC1D5.title: "GamePad for MC"
	quest.6AFD022E4050ECB5.quest_subtitle: "Lets you display real-time information to a connected display board or nixie tube. Don't share personal info."
	quest.6B5D00440E177092.quest_subtitle: "Copy your written book, enchanted book, name tag and train schedule."
	quest.6B6985249AD92B24.quest_subtitle: "Locate biomes"
	quest.6C26214738805896.quest_subtitle: "Essential for any person working with Create. Allows you to see more information about blocks like stress impact."
	quest.6C66239AB766D886.quest_subtitle: "Prevents mob spawning in a big radius."
	quest.6CD6BF0D17D1605E.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Light Bulb"
	quest.6CD6BF0D17D1605E.title: "Edison would be proud!"
	quest.6CE47960B6FEF89D.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to place or extract large bodies of liquid."
	quest.6E2C82E2740AFCD1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain any Graphite Molds"
	quest.6E2C82E2740AFCD1.title: "Graphite Molds"
	quest.6EAF8E8C3EB2D1AF.quest_subtitle: "The Gantry Carriage is a block that can move Contraptions along Gantry Shafts."
	quest.6F4B091DDC613408.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that allow contraptions to create farmland or launch entities."
	quest.6FAB01B97B33913A.quest_subtitle: "Yes redstone is still relevant in create"
	quest.6FD2997BF8805C0D.quest_subtitle: "Good job"
	quest.6FD2997BF8805C0D.title: "Catch one of each type"
	quest.7088750D467E771E.quest_subtitle: "Allows for fine tuning of rpm, meaning you can modify how fast or slow it can be."
	quest.709AE2AFF5DD47EF.title: "Use an Laser to process materials"
	quest.70A45B51E9374A0D.quest_subtitle: "Build with brand new shapes."
	quest.70A45B51E9374A0D.title: "Framed Blocks"
	quest.71151BB59F5C2307.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Use It"
	quest.71151BB59F5C2307.title: "Find Petrol"
	quest.721FAF784829D344.quest_subtitle: "Collect a Bucket of Liquid Estrogen."
	quest.721FAF784829D344.title: "The Source of (Girl) Power"
	quest.727815182560D345.quest_subtitle: "A Brass Tunnel is a machine that can only be placed on Mechanical Belts. It can be decorative or it can be used to split, sort, or combine streams of items fed by belts."
	quest.72910EFCAA5E2C54.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.72910EFCAA5E2C54.quest_subtitle: "Create is a mod that allows for factory style automation. Very useful. You can also hold \"w\" in the menu on the right (JEI) when looking at create items to 'ponder' them (it shows you what they do)."
	quest.72F3965D09F3B6F0.quest_subtitle: "Ever wanted to pipe liquids into your blaze burners? Just hand them a straw and they'll slurp it straight from the pipe.\\n\\nYou can press 'U' on the straw to see what liquids it accepts as well as burn times."
	quest.73A2838E56534342.quest_subtitle: "Allows contraptions to transfer fluids to blocks."
	quest.73FCF73711802617.quest_subtitle: "Use the Voicechat to communicate with players."
	quest.7452A3A5599B09AB.quest_subtitle: "A block that allows input and output of inventories 1 item at a time.\\n\\nOne thing not mentioned by the ponder is that the funnel can drop items on the ground when placed on an inventory and will only keep 1 item on the ground if it's close enough to the block the item lands on."
	quest.748C345C3E28BADB.quest_subtitle: "Put one on recieving end and input then connect with a wire"
	quest.748C345C3E28BADB.title: "Energy transporting"
	quest.748D650D84DE1F4A.quest_subtitle: "The Gearbox is a block used to transfer Rotational power in 4 directions, either horizontally or vertically."
	quest.74ADDF7066B30B3F.quest_subtitle: "Allows for multiple paralell rotational outputs."
	quest.74AFB6A4763E4205.quest_subtitle: "The Stressometer is used to measure the amount of Stress on a Shaft. This stress is the \"load\" of the system."
	quest.74C52604CDA33587.quest_subtitle: "Mechanical Crafters are machines that can automatically craft items."
	quest.757B12A4C7F7D355.quest_subtitle: "A more advanced funnel that allows for filtering and higher stack sizes."
	quest.75A28517E08FE190.quest_subtitle: "Place down a Brass Gearbox"
	quest.75A28517E08FE190.title: "Serious Organization"
	quest.75BA8D3D6C0B9D1C.quest_subtitle: "Basket (Farmer's Delight) can now directly interact with Belt and Mechanical Arm."
	quest.75BA8D3D6C0B9D1C.title: "Smarter Basket"
	quest.75CD1CA790060DC4.quest_subtitle: "Are we nuclear yet?"
	quest.75D14159F084AFBC.quest_subtitle: "he Encased Chain Drive is a block that can transfer rotation much like the Mechanical Belt."
	quest.76C1B8BC5C9B7624.quest_subtitle: "The Encased Fan is a mechanical component that can create air streams. Encased Fans are used for moving entities, vertical transport of items, Bulk Washing, Bulk Blasting, Bulk Haunting, and Bulk Smoking."
	quest.776F0CA023690BC6.quest_subtitle: "Can display text or numbers. This would be useful in making elevators too."
	quest.77DDF57E9E43C076.title: "Use an Spring Coiling Machine to obtain a spring"
	quest.784AFC8271E47A9A.quest_subtitle: "The Radial Chassis is a block used to connect Contraptions."
	quest.785322C002100649.quest_subtitle: "Keep a network running at speed with a powered brake attached"
	quest.785322C002100649.title: "Overpowered"
	quest.798CADF6B8930572.quest_subtitle: "A machine that can autocraft shapeless recepies aswell as mix things like potions.\\n\\nNeeds to rotate at at least 30 rpm to function"
	quest.7B3913CCEBC7717D.quest_subtitle: "Gives off a redstone signal when detecting a train."
	quest.7B4FA7F70BB393A6.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Roller can be used on Contraptions to clear and pave a path."
	quest.7B90A1A66B750F76.quest_subtitle: "Give your Blaze Burner a Enchanting Guide and turn it into a Blaze Enchanter"
	quest.7B90A1A66B750F76.title: "Blaze's New Job"
	quest.7B9D2F7F33818837.quest_subtitle: "Essentially the an upgrade to the millstone, provides some different recipes so it might be worth keeping both around."
	quest.7BE3AAA9531B650B.quest_subtitle: "Crushing Wheels are the more advanced version of the Millstone. It applies Crushing recipes to any items inserted from the direction they are spinning away from."
	quest.7C015A2CA4645E7A.quest_subtitle: "The Adjustable Chain Gearshift functions similarly to Encased Chain Drive, but can change the speed of the output when powered with redstone."
	quest.7C0C87AECC742AC0.quest_subtitle: "Basically electricity = speed"
	quest.7C5CDB413D2EBD0C.quest_subtitle: "Copycat blocks allow you to make steps and panels out of things that typically cannot take those shapes."
	quest.7C77FA44B80B6BB4.quest_subtitle: "This mod requires cookies to work properly. Please insert them into the jar"
	quest.7C77FA44B80B6BB4.title: "Accept and Continue"
	quest.7CAF95DAF8B2ABEC.quest_subtitle: "Blast trough the water to smelt items."
	quest.7CD315EEF62CFCC2.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Graphite"
	quest.7CD315EEF62CFCC2.title: "High Carbon Density"
	quest.7CE1C76E647907BC.quest_subtitle: "The Large Water Wheel is a bigger version of the Water Wheel."
	quest.7D0671C49C20667F.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Drill is a block used to break blocks."
	quest.7DD05DDD6A816DFC.quest_subtitle: "Create: Bitterballen is an addon for Create which adds Dutch snacks. (Quests WIP)"
	quest.7DD05DDD6A816DFC.title: "Bitterballen"
	quest.7E33B2353751C098.quest_subtitle: "The Speedometer measures the speed of Rotational Force."
	quest.7E88F523959EB707.quest_subtitle: "The Powered Latch emits a redstone signal that can be toggled on or off by other signals."
	quest.7E8E6019017D76EC.quest_subtitle: "Sticks to blocks when powered by redstone."
	quest.7E8FC6A9FE02D50B.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Bearing is used to create and rotate Contraptions."
	quest.7EA4E2D90A0FBC21.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to walk underwater like you do on land as well as walk on belts without them moving you, if you think about it, must be really slippery."
	quest.7F4D5B0A7A3CA576.quest_subtitle: "Used to controll the flow of trains across tracks and intersections of tracks."
	quest.7F5E2D38C40E93F7.quest_subtitle: "Lets you transfer a redstone signal wirelessly within a range. No, this is not for Wi-Fi."
	quest.7F5E2D38C40E93F7.title: "Wi-Fi? No?"
	quest.7F9A254B0E33AC68.title: "Beat 1 NPC"
	quest.7FD0E84C5EBA6702.quest_subtitle: "Foundational block for the reactor"
